{"3862870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Delivery Hero's", "steam_appid": 3862870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into <strong>Delivery Hero's</strong>, an open‑city delivery sim where your scooter, strategy, and street smarts determine your success. Race against the clock, juggle fuel stops, outwit traffic and police patrols, and keep those meals piping hot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕒 <strong>Race the Clock:</strong> Every delivery has a timer—late arrivals cost you tips and reputation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏍️ <strong>Customizable Scooter:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engine Upgrades</strong> for top speed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thermal Food Box</strong> upgrades to keep orders hot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Navigation Device</strong> unlocks GPS shortcuts</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⛽ <strong>Fuel Management:</strong> Fuel gauge depletes as you ride—plan stops at scattered gas stations or risk a breakdown.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚦 <strong>Dynamic Traffic AI:</strong> Navigate cars, buses, and unpredictable drivers in real time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚨 <strong>Police Patrols:</strong> Cruise above 40 km/h and you’ll earn a speeding ticket—pay fines or face reputation hits!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏙️ <strong>Living City:</strong> Dozens of restaurants, bustling sidewalks of NPCs, hidden alleys, and secret shortcuts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📈 <strong>Progression &amp; Challenges (Coming Soon):</strong> Level up, unlock new districts, and tackle time‑trial events.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into <strong>Delivery Hero's</strong>, an open‑city delivery sim where your scooter, strategy, and street smarts determine your success. Race against the clock, juggle fuel stops, outwit traffic and police patrols, and keep those meals piping hot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕒 <strong>Race the Clock:</strong> Every delivery has a timer—late arrivals cost you tips and reputation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏍️ <strong>Customizable Scooter:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engine Upgrades</strong> for top speed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thermal Food Box</strong> upgrades to keep orders hot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Navigation Device</strong> unlocks GPS shortcuts</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⛽ <strong>Fuel Management:</strong> Fuel gauge depletes as you ride—plan stops at scattered gas stations or risk a breakdown.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚦 <strong>Dynamic Traffic AI:</strong> Navigate cars, buses, and unpredictable drivers in real time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚨 <strong>Police Patrols:</strong> Cruise above 40 km/h and you’ll earn a speeding ticket—pay fines or face reputation hits!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏙️ <strong>Living City:</strong> Dozens of restaurants, bustling sidewalks of NPCs, hidden alleys, and secret shortcuts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📈 <strong>Progression &amp; Challenges (Coming Soon):</strong> Level up, unlock new districts, and tackle time‑trial events.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Delivery Hero's is an open-city delivery sim. Pilot a customizable scooter, upgrade engine &amp; food box, race against the clock, navigate traffic &amp; fuel stops, avoid police patrols and master hidden shortcuts to become the city’s top courier!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header